# Provider implementations live here, one file per provider. `saasaloy add
# queue-cloudflare` (or queue-memory) drops its file in and appends it to the
# `providers` array in src/index.ts — no edit anywhere else. Writing your own?
# Export a factory returning a `QueueProvider` and add it to that array by hand;
# see the saasaloy-queue skill. This folder is empty until a provider is installed.
